          "text": "Nikki Hiltz, a transgender & non-binary Olympian, speaks out against the event’s new anti-trans policy:\n\n“I don't know who needs to hear this but ZERO trans women competed in the Paris Olympics. Only ONE trans woman weightlifter competed in Tokyo 2021 and she did not win a medal. Can we please stop obsessing over trans people? And idk maybe focus our time, energy, and resources into real problems women's sports face?”"
